										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>Polyester seamless tube/cloth which is used for reverse air dust filter bag. It usually with 6-8 steel rings in the middle of bag, it is widely used in steel plant. The seamless tube has the advantages of high strength, high filtration precision,</p>
